      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "d) Term. The term of office for members of the Council other than public officials shall be three years. Public officials may serve unlimited terms. All other members shall not hold office beyond three consecutive years or a total of six years. Initially one-third of the seats held by representatives of the poor and members of groups shall hold office for one year, one-third shall hold office for two years, and the remaining members shall hold office for three years. Selection of these groups shall be by lot.",
