        1020,
        1130,
        1190
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "g) By-Laws and Procedures. The Council shall adopt a set of by-laws and procedures for the conduct of its affairs. The quorum for the transaction of business shall be one-half of the membership. Quorum for the transaction of business by committees of the Council shall be one-half of the committee membership. The Council shall adopt procedures regarding petitions for membership on the Council by community agencies and representative groups of the poor which believe themselves to be inadequately represented on the Council.",
